        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Roddy Maude-Roxby, Dick Martin, Janelle Price, Dick Emery\n- TV Shows: The Cheap Show, Rowan & Martin's Laugh-In\n- Film: The Maltese Bippy\n\nFacts:\n- Dick Martin co-hosted Rowan & Martin's Laugh-In.\n- Dick Martin starred in The Maltese Bippy.\n- Dick Emery hosted The Cheap Show.\n- Roddy Maude-Roxby was an Australian comedian who appeared with Dick Emery on The Cheap Show.\n- Janelle Price played Wanda, the sidekick on The Cheap Show.\n- Roddy Maude-Roxby died in 1987.",
