        "original_id": "411646a1-d1f4-54e2-969f-0e8f3f9c485a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Norman Panama, Dan Rowan, Dick Martin, Chris Bearde, Janelle Price\n- Works: The Maltese Bippy, Rowan & Martin's Laugh-In, The Cheap Show\n- Companies: Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer\n- Roles: director, host, producer, comedian\n\nFacts:\n- Dan Rowan was born on July 22, 1922, and he was an American comedian.\n- The Maltese Bippy is a 1969 film directed by Norman Panama.\n- Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer released The Maltese Bippy.\n- The Maltese Bippy stars Dan Rowan and Dick Martin.\n- Rowan & Martin's Laugh-In was hosted by comedians Dan Rowan and Dick Martin.\n- The Cheap Show was produced by Chris Bearde.\n- The Cheap Show was hosted by Dick Martin with his side-kick Wanda, played by Janelle Price.\n- Dan Rowan died on September 22, 1987.",
